{"id":"twitter:2076403157324681689","tweet_id":"2076403157324681689","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=2076403157324681689","title":"@DrobotunVitalii @nilesnelis I'll make the patches a Grand Prize, and add some 1st and 2nd place prizes. Do $75 tickets at $10.00. Let me get some mem","summary":"@DrobotunVitalii @nilesnelis I'll make the patches a Grand Prize, and add some 1st and 2nd place prizes. Do $75 tickets at $10.00. Let me get some memes and advertising ready tonight. I'll launch on Wednesday after this week's Toonie. Gimme some time to tease the raffle.","date":"2026-07-12","published":"2026-07-12T20:27:45+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/DrobotunVitalii/status/2076393569586122821","reply_tweet_id":"2076393569586122821","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@DrobotunVitalii @nilesnelis I&#x27;ll make the patches a Grand Prize, and add some 1st and 2nd place prizes.<br><br>Do $75 tickets at $10.00. <br><br>Let me get some memes and advertising ready tonight.<br><br>I&#x27;ll launch on Wednesday after this week&#x27;s Toonie.<br><br> Gimme some time to tease the raffle.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/2076403157324681689","display_date":"July 12, 2026 · 20:27 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:2076391128924909571","tweet_id":"2076391128924909571","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=2076391128924909571","title":"@DrobotunVitalii @nilesnelis It's been slow going for any strategy. Just thinking out loud. $5.00 tickets would take 150-250 in sales. That seems like","summary":"@DrobotunVitalii @nilesnelis It's been slow going for any strategy. Just thinking out loud. $5.00 tickets would take 150-250 in sales. That seems like a high number. Happy to give it a try, though I don't have much reach in these parts. Wondering how long 75 ticket raffle would take?","date":"2026-07-12","published":"2026-07-12T19:39:57+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/DrobotunVitalii/status/2076384680379650130","reply_tweet_id":"2076384680379650130","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@DrobotunVitalii @nilesnelis It&#x27;s been slow going for any strategy. Just thinking out loud.<br><br>$5.00 tickets would take 150-250 in sales. That seems like a high number.<br><br>Happy to give it a try, though I don&#x27;t have much reach in these parts.<br><br>Wondering how long 75 ticket raffle would take?</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/2076391128924909571","display_date":"July 12, 2026 · 19:39 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
