{"id":"twitter:2007485058358432117","tweet_id":"2007485058358432117","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=2007485058358432117","title":"Did the calculator make us worse at math? It's a great question to tease as we think about artificial intelligence as a cognitive amplifier or a tool ","summary":"Did the calculator make us worse at math? It's a great question to tease as we think about artificial intelligence as a cognitive amplifier or a tool removing too much friction from learning https://x.com/txsinatrafan/status/2007478538220286355","date":"2026-01-03","published":"2026-01-03T16:11:49+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Did the calculator make us worse at math?<br><br> It&#x27;s a great question to tease as we think about artificial intelligence as a cognitive amplifier or a tool removing too much friction from learning <a href=\"https://x.com/txsinatrafan/status/2007478538220286355\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/txsinatrafan/status/2007478538220286355</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/2007485058358432117","display_date":"January 03, 2026 · 16:11 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:2007484646150553827","tweet_id":"2007484646150553827","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=2007484646150553827","title":"@txsinatrafan @faceyouhate 1956 is the first time I can find reference to someone using \"Cognitive Amplifier\" in a way Satya is using it in 2026 but A","summary":"@txsinatrafan @faceyouhate 1956 is the first time I can find reference to someone using \"Cognitive Amplifier\" in a way Satya is using it in 2026 but Ashby uses \"Intelligence-Amplifier\" https://books.google.com/books?hl=en&lr=&id=usu6EZj79pgC&oi=fnd&pg=PA191&dq=ashby+ross++design+for+an+intelligence+amplifier+1956&ots=jRlxDBZwCD&sig=HossWhxBOE4KO5mmbZkH05f5Se","date":"2026-01-03","published":"2026-01-03T16:10:11+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/2007483445023519060","reply_tweet_id":"2007483445023519060","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@txsinatrafan @faceyouhate 1956 is the first time I can find reference to someone using &quot;Cognitive Amplifier&quot; in a way Satya is using it in 2026 but Ashby uses &quot;Intelligence-Amplifier&quot;<br><br><a href=\"https://books.google.com/books?hl=en&amp;lr=&amp;id=usu6EZj79pgC&amp;oi=fnd&amp;pg=PA191&amp;dq=ashby+ross++design+for+an+intelligence+amplifier+1956&amp;ots=jRlxDBZwCD&amp;sig=HossWhxBOE4KO5mmbZkH05f5Sew#v=onepage&amp;q&amp;f=false\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://books.google.com/books?hl=en&amp;lr=&amp;id=usu6EZj79pgC&amp;oi=fnd&amp;pg=PA191&amp;dq=ashby+ross++design+for+an+intelligence+amplifier+1956&amp;ots=jRlxDBZwCD&amp;sig=HossWhxBOE4KO5mmbZkH05f5Sew#v=onepage&amp;q&amp;f=false</a> <a href=\"https://t.co/lp47xjWJ1W\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/lp47xjWJ1W</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/3b38982b0669ccdf25075cf63cee3604.png\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/2007484646150553827","display_date":"January 03, 2026 · 16:10 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/3b38982b0669ccdf25075cf63cee3604.png"]}
{"id":"twitter:2007483445023519060","tweet_id":"2007483445023519060","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=2007483445023519060","title":"@txsinatrafan @faceyouhate But here is a banger from 1959 for folks looking for early history into Artificial Intelligence Pierce, A. M. (1959). A con","summary":"@txsinatrafan @faceyouhate But here is a banger from 1959 for folks looking for early history into Artificial Intelligence Pierce, A. M. (1959). A concise bibliography of the literature on artificial intelligence. https://jgregorymcverry.com/readings/pierce1959concisebibliographyofartificialIntelligence.pdf","date":"2026-01-03","published":"2026-01-03T16:05:25+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/2007482443721289882","reply_tweet_id":"2007482443721289882","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@txsinatrafan @faceyouhate But here is a banger from 1959 for folks looking for early history into Artificial Intelligence<br><br>Pierce, A. M. (1959). A concise bibliography of the literature on artificial intelligence.<br><br><a href=\"https://jgregorymcverry.com/readings/pierce1959concisebibliographyofartificialIntelligence.pdf\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://jgregorymcverry.com/readings/pierce1959concisebibliographyofartificialIntelligence.pdf</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/2007483445023519060","display_date":"January 03, 2026 · 16:05 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:2007482443721289882","tweet_id":"2007482443721289882","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=2007482443721289882","title":"@txsinatrafan @faceyouhate \"Systems Thinking\" as a field emerged from a mi of theoretical artificial intelligence work, Soviet Psychology which began ","summary":"@txsinatrafan @faceyouhate \"Systems Thinking\" as a field emerged from a mi of theoretical artificial intelligence work, Soviet Psychology which began to show up in English, mixed with information processing models https://jgregorymcverry/readings/Clartcey2008Is_consciousness_embodied.pdf","date":"2026-01-03","published":"2026-01-03T16:01:26+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/2007479871274955088","reply_tweet_id":"2007479871274955088","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@txsinatrafan @faceyouhate &quot;Systems Thinking&quot; as a field emerged from a mi of theoretical artificial intelligence work, Soviet Psychology which began to show up in English, mixed with information processing models<br><br><a href=\"https://jgregorymcverry/readings/Clartcey2008Is_consciousness_embodied.pdf\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://jgregorymcverry/readings/Clartcey2008Is_consciousness_embodied.pdf</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/2007482443721289882","display_date":"January 03, 2026 · 16:01 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
