{"id":"twitter:2007478674543501812","tweet_id":"2007478674543501812","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=2007478674543501812","title":"@txsinatrafan @faceyouhate The field of Cognition and Artificial Intelligence can be broken down basically into the Information Processing theorists w","summary":"@txsinatrafan @faceyouhate The field of Cognition and Artificial Intelligence can be broken down basically into the Information Processing theorists who utilize the computer as a metaphor for the mind and situativist who place greater affordances on the environment as a mediator for learning. Fun stuff","date":"2026-01-03","published":"2026-01-03T15:46:27+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/2007477482220384268","reply_tweet_id":"2007477482220384268","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@txsinatrafan @faceyouhate The field of Cognition and Artificial Intelligence can be broken down basically into the Information Processing theorists who utilize the computer as a metaphor for the mind and situativist who place greater affordances on the environment as a mediator for learning.<br><br>Fun stuff</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/2007478674543501812","display_date":"January 03, 2026 · 15:46 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
