{"id":"twitter:2076325997775814728","tweet_id":"2076325997775814728","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=2076325997775814728","title":"@indigonl @Blaszczaki @serhii_rieznik @Lorelei_0502 They were the first one's I did. Wanted to support Marines of Kherson. I didn't have a clue or ski","summary":"@indigonl @Blaszczaki @serhii_rieznik @Lorelei_0502 They were the first one's I did. Wanted to support Marines of Kherson. I didn't have a clue or skills. Now I just don't have skills. Still carving them by knife, and then burning. Realized that messed up my lines. Now everything is hand drawn or done with transfer paper.","date":"2026-07-12","published":"2026-07-12T15:21:08+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/indigonl/status/2076322473583251604","reply_tweet_id":"2076322473583251604","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@indigonl @Blaszczaki @serhii_rieznik @Lorelei_0502 They were the first one&#x27;s I did. Wanted to support Marines of Kherson. I didn&#x27;t have a clue or skills.<br><br>Now I just don&#x27;t have skills. <br><br>Still carving them by knife, and then burning.<br><br>Realized that messed up my lines.<br><br>Now everything is hand drawn or done with transfer paper.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/2076325997775814728","display_date":"July 12, 2026 · 15:21 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
