{"id":"twitter:2007119170186387658","tweet_id":"2007119170186387658","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=2007119170186387658","title":"You have to start with semi-structured interviews across stakeholders and follow the data wherever it takes you Then map the journey It's sounds super","summary":"You have to start with semi-structured interviews across stakeholders and follow the data wherever it takes you Then map the journey It's sounds super nerdy, but I really enjoy doing data flows as we start the DLP process","date":"2026-01-02","published":"2026-01-02T15:57:55+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/2007118246064029970","reply_tweet_id":"2007118246064029970","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>You have to start with semi-structured interviews across stakeholders and follow the data wherever it takes you<br><br>Then map the journey<br><br>It&#x27;s sounds super nerdy, but I really enjoy doing data flows as we start the DLP process</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/2007119170186387658","display_date":"January 02, 2026 · 15:57 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:2007118246064029970","tweet_id":"2007118246064029970","source":"twitter","type":"photos","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=2007118246064029970","title":"Anyone geek out like me doing business flows and data flow diagrams? Not really art, but it's not a science either. Yet when I design diagrams I appro","summary":"Anyone geek out like me doing business flows and data flow diagrams? Not really art, but it's not a science either. Yet when I design diagrams I approach them the same as any art project through the lens of a scientific method. I think its training as a qualitative researcher https://t.co/j7w0fhNY4J","date":"2026-01-02","published":"2026-01-02T15:54:14+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Anyone geek out like me doing business flows and data flow diagrams?<br><br>Not really art, but it&#x27;s not a science either.<br><br>Yet when I design diagrams I approach them the same as any art project through the lens of a scientific method.<br><br>I think its training as a qualitative researcher <a href=\"https://t.co/j7w0fhNY4J\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/j7w0fhNY4J</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/ba0cf19ff29fdde2207427c2771f050d.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/2007118246064029970","display_date":"January 02, 2026 · 15:54 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/ba0cf19ff29fdde2207427c2771f050d.jpg"]}
{"id":"twitter:2007112985978994974","tweet_id":"2007112985978994974","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=2007112985978994974","title":"Do not hold yourself up to the accomplishments of others in the efforts to defeat evil. It's not your story. Doing more than zero is the only acceptab","summary":"Do not hold yourself up to the accomplishments of others in the efforts to defeat evil. It's not your story. Doing more than zero is the only acceptable answer. Just do something.","date":"2026-01-02","published":"2026-01-02T15:33:20+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Do not hold yourself up to the accomplishments of others in the efforts to defeat evil.<br><br>It&#x27;s not your story. <br><br>Doing more than zero is the only acceptable answer.<br><br>Just do something.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/2007112985978994974","display_date":"January 02, 2026 · 15:33 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
