{"id":"twitter:2007106962316800190","tweet_id":"2007106962316800190","source":"twitter","type":"photos","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=2007106962316800190","title":"I broke down and paid for a subscription music service rather than reset up my media server. I always wanted to teach my kids to own physical media an","summary":"I broke down and paid for a subscription music service rather than reset up my media server. I always wanted to teach my kids to own physical media and support artists, but the access to such a vast library of music is so inticing I'll get my server back up soon, maybe https://t.co/R9ffQbnA8G","date":"2026-01-02","published":"2026-01-02T15:09:24+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>I broke down and paid for a subscription music service rather than reset up my media server.<br><br>I always wanted to teach my kids to own physical media and support artists, but the access to such a vast library of music is so inticing<br><br>I&#x27;ll get my server back up soon, maybe <a href=\"https://t.co/R9ffQbnA8G\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/R9ffQbnA8G</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/a5b3f7738de89a88ed711062ded9eb7a.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/2007106962316800190","display_date":"January 02, 2026 · 15:09 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/a5b3f7738de89a88ed711062ded9eb7a.jpg"]}
