{"id":"twitter:2076320806695469506","tweet_id":"2076320806695469506","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=2076320806695469506","title":"@Blaszczaki @serhii_rieznik @Lorelei_0502 One of my favorite pieces, but I was still new, and using too much pressure, is one for the old 39th Marine ","summary":"@Blaszczaki @serhii_rieznik @Lorelei_0502 One of my favorite pieces, but I was still new, and using too much pressure, is one for the old 39th Marine Coastal Defense Brigade I got a wee bit of yellow stain on the heart, picking up the wrong sponge brush but it was my first mixed media piece. @indigonl got this one https://t.co/5K3f8Dry3c","date":"2026-07-12","published":"2026-07-12T15:00:31+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/2076315624377139635","reply_tweet_id":"2076315624377139635","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@Blaszczaki @serhii_rieznik @Lorelei_0502 One of my favorite pieces, but I was still new, and using too much pressure, is one for the old 39th Marine Coastal Defense Brigade<br><br>I got a wee bit of yellow stain on the heart, picking up the wrong sponge brush<br><br>but it was my first mixed media piece. @indigonl got this one <a href=\"https://t.co/5K3f8Dry3c\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/5K3f8Dry3c</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/7a87c86794905a22bd607af1673ba42c.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/2076320806695469506","display_date":"July 12, 2026 · 15:00 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/7a87c86794905a22bd607af1673ba42c.jpg"]}
