{"id":"twitter:2076315624377139635","tweet_id":"2076315624377139635","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=2076315624377139635","title":"@Blaszczaki @serhii_rieznik I need to do a new 34th with the river Lynx. I want to do a Cerebus for the 38th and @Lorelei_0502's as well. I am thinkin","summary":"@Blaszczaki @serhii_rieznik I need to do a new 34th with the river Lynx. I want to do a Cerebus for the 38th and @Lorelei_0502's as well. I am thinking about doing a composition piece to celebrate all the new Marine Brigades. Some of the oldest units of a free Ukraine. Here is your Kraken piece started https://t.co/TOAFly6Wfd","date":"2026-07-12","published":"2026-07-12T14:39:55+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/Blaszczaki/status/2076311150724026525","reply_tweet_id":"2076311150724026525","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@Blaszczaki @serhii_rieznik I need to do a new 34th with the river Lynx.<br><br>I want to do a Cerebus for the 38th and @Lorelei_0502&#x27;s as well.<br><br>I am thinking about doing a composition piece to celebrate all the new Marine Brigades. Some of the oldest units of a free Ukraine.<br><br>Here is your Kraken piece started <a href=\"https://t.co/TOAFly6Wfd\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/TOAFly6Wfd</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/79c8133aad31486eb296f857dd2c8d86.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/2076315624377139635","display_date":"July 12, 2026 · 14:39 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/79c8133aad31486eb296f857dd2c8d86.jpg"]}
