{"id":"twitter:2006761933765255533","tweet_id":"2006761933765255533","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=2006761933765255533","title":"We don't, but the National Debt is a major problem. You can't fix a Balance sheet by looking at the cost column alone. If you control costs, and add r","summary":"We don't, but the National Debt is a major problem. You can't fix a Balance sheet by looking at the cost column alone. If you control costs, and add revenue the debt growth slows. It's really simple math. https://x.com/wholemars/status/2006397618801479685","date":"2026-01-01","published":"2026-01-01T16:18:23+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>We don&#x27;t, but the National Debt is a major problem.<br><br>You can&#x27;t fix a Balance sheet by looking at the cost column alone.<br><br>If you control costs, and add revenue the debt growth slows.<br><br>It&#x27;s really simple math. <a href=\"https://x.com/wholemars/status/2006397618801479685\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/wholemars/status/2006397618801479685</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/2006761933765255533","display_date":"January 01, 2026 · 16:18 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
